The referenced behavior includes Vast offer normalization, host blacklisting,
reliability-aware offer choice, leak-safe provisioning, forced cleanup, restart
reconciliation, boot monitoring, and destruction-gated single replacement.

No source code was copied from LoRA Dataset Studio. ComfyUI Cloud Run contains
an independent, dependency-free implementation scoped to this custom node.
